Description: Tools for teaching and analysing agricultural experiments.
    Randomizes and draws completely randomized, randomized block,
    factorial (two and three factors), split-plot and split-split-plot
    designs; performs analysis of variance for completely randomized,
    randomized block and Latin square designs, double and triple factorial,
    split-plot and split-split-plot schemes, with unfolding of significant
    interactions; six multiple comparison tests, including the Tukey test
    and a cluster-based grouping of means; polynomial regression for
    quantitative factors; descriptive statistics, frequency tables and
    histograms; and didactic simulations of confidence intervals and mean
    tests, also available through an interactive 'shiny' application.
